meshcore-linux (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First public release.
  * mesh::Radio over pymc_usb wire protocol v0.7 (LinuxTcpRadio).
  * Full mesh::Mesh + CommonCLICallbacks repeater (LinuxRepeaterMesh):
    adverts, ACL, loop detection, region scoping, region save, remote
    LoRa admin (login, stats, neighbours, CLI bridge).
  * HTTP/JSON configurator on :8080 with live NodePrefs overlay, CLI
    terminal and ImageHTML form mirroring the upstream web wizard.
  * Identity inside /etc/Meshcore-Linux/config.json — lazy-generated
    via getrandom(2), atomically persisted, preserved across upgrades.
  * Tag-prefix ("XX|...") admin TXT-CLI reflection so MeshCore mobile
    and desktop clients work over LoRa unchanged.
  * Packet log under /var/lib/Meshcore-Linux/packets.log.
  * systemd unit hardened (ProtectSystem=strict, ReadWritePaths,
    StateDirectory, Restart=always).

